        "title": "Service desk check",
        "brief": "Ten items from the Quayholt IT service desk: calls, a voicemail, emails and a sign-in prompt on your phone. For each one, pick what you'd do, then tick what you noticed. Ring back or Verify means checking on a number already on file. You'll see how you did at the end. Reporting or checking something real never costs you anything.",
